+src/router/reg-exp-router/trie.ts:55 — `this.paths[path] = [++this.#index, paramAssoc]` records an index one higher than the `this.#index` value just embedded in the node, so `#buildMatcher` stores handlers at the wrong slot and every dynamic route resolves to an undefined handler list (TypeError on `handlerData[i].length` while building the matcher).
